                    {
                        "translation_id": "e245776e-0ea5-4a0e-ae00-4a4d05c1ea6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "7aa57489-a234-3601-9e11-651d4928cd07",
                        "source_sense_id": "a75423c7-7cdc-37a5-8423-e1d1a08f51e2",
                        "source_sense_description": "sekundärer Inhaltsstoff in Organismen, der sich vom Isopren ableitet",
                        "target_lang_word": "terpene",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terpene",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c09d4345-c35a-3cde-a2be-13921bb850f0",
                                        "entry_id": "9c936c12-fc5c-3a08-a0ca-72af05a958e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a very large class of naturally occurring and synthetic organic compounds formally derived from the hydrocarbon isoprene; they include many volatile compounds used in perfume and food flavours, turpentine, the steroids, the carotene pigments and rubber."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f45fa8ee-76ee-44fb-bf1c-1181a0fe9cf1",
                                                "sense_id": "c09d4345-c35a-3cde-a2be-13921bb850f0",
                                                "text": "Naval stores production is based upon exploiting the terpene chemical defense system of the pine tree, which protects against wood-decaying fungi and insect pests such as bark beetles (Dendroctonus Ips sp.). […] Pine oleoresin is a complex mixture of about 30 to 50 different terpene molecules, chiefly composed of diterpene resin acids and monoterpene essential oils, which impart different physical and biotic properties (Zinkel and Russell 1989)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd015cf8-5284-4149-8655-24d7296068a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7aa57489-a234-3601-9e11-651d4928cd07",
                        "source_sense_id": "a75423c7-7cdc-37a5-8423-e1d1a08f51e2",
                        "source_sense_description": "sekundärer Inhaltsstoff in Organismen, der sich vom Isopren ableitet",
                        "target_lang_word": "terpène",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terpène",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ffb8b62-fa87-33bd-8cfe-f3dea6b4a8f8",
                                        "entry_id": "bc022636-adbb-30f9-937d-82d9d41d0c40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Composé naturel issu majoritairement des plantes, formé d’unités d’isoprène (C₅H₈), présent dans de nombreuses huiles essentielles et doué d’activités biologiques variées, souvent exploité pour ses propriétés aromatiques, antiseptiques ou anti-inflammatoires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pharmacognosie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fa7da3c-cd29-42cc-b9ed-0e9b44ecb9d0",
                                                "sense_id": "9ffb8b62-fa87-33bd-8cfe-f3dea6b4a8f8",
                                                "text": "Quant aux terpènes ils sont inutiles au point de vue odeur et gênants car ils sont peu solubles dans l’alcool, très disposés à rancir et souvent même d’une odeur, mais désagréable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
